sequenceDiagram
  actor Person
  participant Provider
  participant Auth as UnifiedAuthService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  Person->>Provider: Authenticate with new provider
  Provider-->>Auth: New subject and email metadata
  Auth->>DB: Find provider + subject
  DB-->>Auth: Not found
  Auth->>DB: Find canonicalized email
  DB-->>Auth: Existing User U123 found
  Auth->>DB: Record AUTH_ACCOUNT_LINK_REQUIRED
  Auth-->>Person: ACCOUNT_LINK_REQUIRED
  Note over Person,Auth: No automatic merge and no new duplicate User
